[N 37-38 Swamp of Sorrows]
[D Forever Shaman 30-60 (Braedyn)\\The Swamp of Sorrows from the Harborage and Watcher Biggs: Father Tuttle's escort, Karana's Lost Ones, Noboru, Biggs's caravan-and-driftwood chain to Nethergarde Keep, Galen's escape, the Draenethyst crystals and the Twisted Earth Totems; then a Booty Bay hop for the Bloodsail Buccaneers and Tokal's story. Ends with the gold break.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]|cffffffffLevel check|r  -  this chapter wants level 37: the Bloodsail quests in Booty Bay need 37 and their Swashbucklers are 41-43; the Swamp quests need 30 and its mobs are 34-41. Under 37 on arrival: do the Swamp first as written (the Booty Bay leg comes last, by when you are 38); if still under 37 at the end, skip the Bloodsail leg (it is self-contained, nothing is carried) and do only Tokal
[OC]|cffffffffSwamp of Sorrows|r  -  you start in Ironforge where chapter 35 left you, hearth = Thelsamar and it stays there: the Swamp has no Alliance inn (the only one is Horde, in Stonard) and Nethergarde Keep has none. About 37,320 quest XP in all, every quest plain; the only collection with a budget is the shaman's 5 Earth totems. The chapter ends in Booty Bay
[OC]|cffffcc00Carried in:|r Shaman: Storm, Earth, and Fire (79358, Veyric, chapter 29) holds the Water, Air and Fire totems; the Earth totems drop here. On the Lam (79235, Bibbly F'utzbuckle, chapter 33) is handed in to Tokal in Booty Bay at the end
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00Training:|r Eldrun first, for the level 36 row if chapter 35 did not buy it; the level 38 row waits for chapter 39d

